  "description": "Beargrease C Eagle 90 is the go-to fat-tire trail bike for snowy singletrack laps, winter ultras, and anything in between. It rides like a fat-tire trail bike thanks to its long wheelbase and balanced weight distribution. Its stiff, lightweight carbon fiber frame helps you hold your line when pedaling through soft, challenging terrain. Beargrease’s 27.5 x 4.5\" tires have no trouble finding traction or rolling over trail obstacles, and their huge footprint offers plenty of float on soft surfaces like snow and sand. It also comes loaded with cargo and accessory mounts for extending your Adventure by Bike to far-off places. The SRAM Eagle 90 components are sturdy, shift reliably, and offer all the gearing you need for steep climbs and making up time.",
